   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Edu.social workers Arkang</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Socialarbetarutb. Archang</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den nystartade universitetsutbildningen f&#xf6;r socialarbetare i Arkhangelsk. Under 1998 bes&#xf6;kte en grupp p&#xe5; tio universitetsl&#xe4;rare Ume&#xe5; tre g&#xe5;nger, en vecka &#xe5;t g&#xe5;ngen, f&#xf6;r  utbildning och utbyte av erfarenheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to strengthen the newly started training at university level of social workers in Arkhangelsk.During 1998 a group of ten university teachers came to Ume&#xe5; three times  for a week of training and exchange of experiences.</narrative>
  </description>
